{"channelId":"UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","row":["ACC NYC",60400,"Welcome to the official Animal Care Centers of NYC (ACC) YouTube channel!  Individuals from all over New York City come to Animal Care Centers every day of the week for reasons as diverse as surrendering pets, reclaiming lost cats and dogs, and adopting new furry family members. We strive to find loving homes for homeless and abandoned cats, dogs, and rabbits, both by adopting animals directly to the public and by partnering with more than 300 dedicated animal placement organizations (our New Hope partners). Our field services division responds to calls from the public to help keep NYC communities safe and rescue animals in need, and we have facilities in all five boroughs.","info@nycacc.org; adopt@nycacc.org; CommunityCats@nycacc.org; donate@nycacc.org; foil@nycacc.org; foster@nycacc.org; hr@nycacc.org; media@nycacc.org; volunteerinfo@nycacc.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:31.239Z","channelId":"UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8e55639c935fc3cb2de57341d987bb689a2c7a035f888ba91e58cd6250cdc531","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"20b452dee91e8d547369c790f5e56f39acb6d99cb62a1390a3844a6451fdb011"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:20:53.686Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":60400,"raw":"60.4K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDLqd1-4Xa8r9fIP0FKqHBw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:31.239Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@nycacc.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://www.nycacc.o